Rips_SetReferrerCustomFee
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert.
└── when the caller is the owner
    ├── when referrer is zero address
    │   └── it should revert.
    ├── when the fee is greater than FEE_BASE
    │   └── it should revert.
    └── when inputs are valid
        ├── it should update the referrer's customFeePercent.
        └── it should emit a {ReferrerCustomFeeUpdated} event.
